"""
A team's owned-component notification preference.

excludedEventTypes is an OPT-OUT list: the effective set is every event type
ReARM emits MINUS these, so a team hears about a new class of event happening to
its components without editing anything. VEX_STATE_CHANGED is never included --
nothing emits it, and its payload carries no affected releases, so an
ownership-scoped subscription could not match it in any case.
"""
